  {
   "id": "c209875297d7",
   "unit_id": "c209875297d72f894f5a0d2cded9ccff3b07dc04cfd09419729694635d4bb569",
   "revision_key": "7152e1c35ac15933c87ce83ec19b97dc5512d1fc09a233dd38d5408de6a67a13",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 39998,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/zones/temple-of-creation/objects.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "This incredibly beautiful -- and powerful -- trident is made of the rare metal orichalcum. An amazing pearl is seated in head of the trident, as it spreads into three razor sharp prongs.\nIt is imbued with the greatest strengths of all of the most powerful Naga warriors.\nSlasul gave it to you as a sign of his faith in you. It is a sign of hope for all of the Naloren race, that one outside of their tribe could be so trusted.",
   "target": "这柄美得令人难以置信——且威力强大——的三叉戟由稀有的奥利哈刚金属打造而成。一颗璀璨的珍珠镶嵌在叉头处，向前分出三道锋利的尖刺。\n它被灌注了所有最强大的娜迦战士的至高力量。\n萨拉苏尔将它赐予你，作为他对你信任的象征。它也是纳鲁一族全体的希望——一个部落之外的人竟能获得如此信任。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/zones/temple-of-creation/objects.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    79
   ],
